{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32833","headline":"游四明山刘樊二真人祠题山下孙氏居 · 李频","name":"游四明山刘樊二真人祠题山下孙氏居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久在仙坛下，全家是地仙。\n池塘来乳洞，禾黍接芝田。\n起看青山足，还倾白酒眠。\n不知尘世事，双鬓逐流年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}